    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ENG1_U02_L05_GP_Q01</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.ENG1.R.04</p><p><strong>Passage:</strong> Sing of the guardian who held the bridge while the river rose. <strong>Question:</strong> Which epic trait appears?</p>]]></text></questiontext>
